UPDATE companies SET description='Curbside Apparel operates in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, as an employment program of the Homeless Alliance, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization. The social enterprise was established to provide dignified employment and job skills training to individuals transitioning out of homelessness, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed. The program is structured around a paid screen printing certification that equips participants with marketable skills.

