UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Craft Inc operates from West Warwick, Rhode Island, where it has produced outdoor cushions and related products for nearly three decades. The company is family owned and operated, rooted in textile and manufacturing traditions, though the exact founding year and founders’ names are not publicly disclosed. The business began with a focus on high‑quality, fashionable cushions designed to withstand the elements.

