UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Sheet Metal of Louisiana operates from Lafayette, Louisiana. The business was acquired in 2011 by Chad Duhon, who had worked at the shop since 1995 and served as foreman before taking ownership. Duhon brought two decades of sheet metal experience, including earlier work at Butcher Air Conditioning. In 2011, Jared Breaux joined as co-owner and partner; Breaux had previously worked at the company from 2002 to 2005 and later ran gutter and patio cover ventures before returning. Breaux also served in the U.S. Army after studying at the University of Louisiana at Lafayette.

The shop specializes in custom sheet metal fabrication, offering welding, plasma cutting, and forming for a range of products including awnings, Cajun microwaves, restaurant hood exhausts, HVAC ductwork, fan shrouds, drain pans, flashing, louvers, chimney caps, and seamless gutters in half-round and K-style profiles. Beyond fabrication, the company provides installation of its own products and of prefabricated restaurant-grade exhaust hoods, gutter cleaning and guard installation, AC ductwork maintenance with custom replacement parts, and sales of metal panels for patios, siding, and other construction uses.

Customers span residential homeowners, commercial contractors, and restaurant operators throughout the Lafayette area. The company’s ductwork and gutter services target HVAC and building maintenance markets, while its metal panel sales serve patio and siding construction projects.

The founders emphasize hands-on oversight: Duhon manages shop operations and estimating, while Breaux handles job scheduling, on-site supervision, and customer relationships. Their combined background in sheet metal, gutter systems, and industrial supply chains informs the company’s focus on craftsmanship and responsive service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom sheet metal fabrication", "Welding", "Plasma cutting", "Awning fabrication", "Cajun microwave fabrication", "Restaurant hood exhaust fabrication", "HVAC ductwork fabrication", "Fan shroud fabrication", "Drain pan fabrication", "Flashing fabrication", "Louver fabrication", "Chimney cap fabrication", "Seamless gutter fabrication (half-round and K-style)", "Product installation", "Prefabricated exhaust hood installation", "Gutter cleaning and maintenance", "Gutter guard installation", "AC ductwork maintenance", "Custom ductwork component fabrication", "Metal panel sales"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Construction", "HVAC", "Restaurant", "Patio and siding"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom fabrication of virtually any sheet metal product", "Installation of prefabricated restaurant-grade exhaust hoods", "Gutter cleaning and leaf guard installation", "AC ductwork maintenance with custom parts", "Metal panel supply for patios and siding"], "facts_used": ["Location: Lafayette, Louisiana -> db", "Chad Duhon acquired company in 2011 after working there since 1995 -> /about-us", "Jared Breaux became co-owner in 2011, prior experience at company 2002-2005, US Army service -> /about-us", "Services: installation, gutter cleaning, ductwork maintenance, metal panel sales -> /services", "Processes: welding, plasma cutting, awning, Cajun microwaves, hood exhaust, A/C ductwork, fan shrouds, drain pan, flashing, louvers, chimney caps, seamless gutters -> /", "Products: awnings, Cajun microwaves, hood exhau