UPDATE companies SET description='DECA Manufacturing, Inc. operates from Lexington, Ohio, where it has been owned and operated since its founding. The company is led by President and CEO Cameron Haring, who has been recognized by Forbes for his investments in the business. While the exact founding year is not disclosed, DECA notes over 40 years in the business of making manufacturers look good.

